  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large tagine or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the Tunisian spice blend, cumin, coriander, paprika, and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the barramundi fillets and cook for 8-10 minutes, or until cooked through.",
